@lang en
IMPORT `nd67-art5-7-cover`

-- Decree 67/2023/NĐ-CP, Article 8 and Annex I (Phụ lục I): the premium.
-- Money is VND. Every figure of Annex I is "chưa bao gồm thuế giá trị gia tăng" (VAT not
-- included); no rule here adds VAT, because the source adds none.
-- DECREE 220/2026 does not amend Article 8 or Annex I (it replaces Annex III, the construction
-- annex, and nothing else among the annexes): one rule answers for both vintages.

