-- src:2120 | định tại mục VI. Phí bảo hiểm của xe đầu kéo rơ-moóc là phí của cả đầu kéo và
-- src:2121 | rơ moóc.
-- src:2122 | 5. Máy kéo
-- src:2123 | Tính bằng 120% phí bảo hiểm của xe chở hàng có trọng tải dưới 3 tấn quy định
-- src:2124 | tại mục VI. Phí bảo hiểm của máy kéo là phí bảo hiểm của cả máy kéo và rơ moóc.
-- src:2125 | 6. Xe buýt
-- src:2126 | Tính bằng phí bảo hiểm của xe không kinh doanh vận tải cùng số chỗ quy định
-- src:2127 | tại mục IV.
-- VII.1: 120% of the premium of the vehicle of the same type, "quy định mục IV và mục VI":
-- only a vehicle of section IV or VI can be the reference.
-- VII.3(a): 120% of the pickup or minivan "quy định tại mục V" (section V, 933.000).
-- VII.3(b): 120% of the car under 6 seats of section IV (437.000).
-- VII.3(c): 120% of the goods vehicle of the same designed payload, or of the under-3-tonne
-- goods vehicle where no designed payload is set.
-- VII.4: 150% of the goods vehicle over 15 tonnes; it is the premium for the tractor unit and
-- its trailer together. VII.5: 120% of the under-3-tonne goods vehicle; tractor and trailer
-- together. VII.6: a bus pays what a car not used for transport business of the same seats pays.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 8(1), Annex I section A
GIVEN class IS A `A vehicle class in Annex I`
GIVETH AN EITHER `A problem with the facts` NUMBER
`Annex I section A — the premium for a 1-year term, VAT not included, for` class MEANS
    CONSIDER class
    WHEN `a two-wheeled motorcycle` cc THEN
        IF   cc AT MOST 0 THEN LEFT `a cylinder capacity, a number of seats or a payload is not a positive number`
        ELSE IF cc LESS THAN 50
             THEN RIGHT `Annex I A.I.1 — a two-wheeled motorcycle under 50 cc`
             ELSE RIGHT `Annex I A.I.2 — a two-wheeled motorcycle of 50 cc or more`
    WHEN `a three-wheeled motorcycle`                    THEN RIGHT `Annex I A.II — a three-wheeled motorcycle`
    WHEN `an electric moped`                             THEN RIGHT `Annex I A.III.1 — an electric moped`
    WHEN `another moped or similar motor vehicle`        THEN RIGHT `Annex I A.III.2 — another moped or similar motor vehicle`
    WHEN `a car not used for transport business` seats   THEN
        IF   seats AT MOST 0 THEN LEFT `a cylinder capacity, a number of seats or a payload is not a positive number`
        ELSE RIGHT (`Annex I A.IV — a car not used for transport business, of` seats)
    WHEN `a pickup or minivan not used for transport business` THEN RIGHT `Annex I A.IV.5 — a pickup or minivan`
    WHEN `a car used for transport business` seats       THEN
        IF   seats AT MOST 0 THEN LEFT `a cylinder capacity, a number of seats or a payload is not a positive number`
        ELSE RIGHT (`Annex I A.V — a car used for transport business, of` seats)
    WHEN `a pickup or minivan used for transport business` THEN RIGHT `Annex I A.V.23 — a pickup or minivan`
    WHEN `a goods vehicle (truck)` tonnes                THEN
        IF   tonnes AT MOST 0 THEN LEFT `a cylinder capacity, a number of seats or a payload is not a positive number`
        ELSE RIGHT (`Annex I A.VI — a goods vehicle of payload` tonnes)
    WHEN `a driving-school vehicle` same                 THEN
        IF   `in section IV or VI of Annex I` same
        THEN CONSIDER `Annex I section A — the premium for a 1-year term, VAT not included, for` same
             WHEN LEFT problem THEN LEFT problem
             WHEN RIGHT p      THEN RIGHT (p TIMES 120%)
        ELSE LEFT `the vehicle named for Annex I section VII.1 is not in section IV or VI`
    WHEN `a taxi` seats                                  THEN
        IF   seats AT MOST 0 THEN LEFT `a cylinder capacity, a number of seats or a payload is not a positive number`
        ELSE RIGHT (`Annex I A.V — a car used for transport business, of` seats TIMES 170%)
    WHEN `an ambulance`                                  THEN RIGHT (`Annex I A.V.23 — a pickup or minivan` TIMES 120%)
    WHEN `a cash-in-transit vehicle`                     THEN RIGHT (`Annex I A.IV.1 — a car under 6 seats` TIMES 120%)
    WHEN `another special-purpose car` payload           THEN
        CONSIDER payload
        WHEN NOTHING  THEN RIGHT (`Annex I A.VI.1 — under 3 tonnes` TIMES 120%)
        WHEN JUST t   THEN
            IF   t AT MOST 0 THEN LEFT `a cylinder capacity, a number of seats or a payload is not a positive number`
            ELSE RIGHT (`Annex I A.VI — a goods vehicle of payload` t TIMES 120%)
    WHEN `a tractor unit with its trailer`               THEN RIGHT (`Annex I A.VI.4 — over 15 tonnes` TIMES 150%)
    WHEN `a tractor with its trailer`                    THEN RIGHT (`Annex I A.VI.1 — under 3 tonnes` TIMES 120%)
    WHEN `a bus` seats                                   THEN
        IF   seats AT MOST 0 THEN LEFT `a cylinder capacity, a number of seats or a payload is not a positive number`
        ELSE RIGHT (`Annex I A.IV — a car not used for transport business, of` seats)

GIVEN class IS A `A vehicle class in Annex I`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`in section IV or VI of Annex I` class MEANS
    CONSIDER class
    WHEN `a car not used for transport business` s             THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a pickup or minivan not used for transport business` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a goods vehicle (truck)` t                           THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

§§ `Annex I, section B — a term other than 1 year`

-- The premium for a term other than 1 year is the annual premium of the vehicle's class divided
-- by 365 and multiplied by the days of the term; for a term of 30 days or less, the annual
-- premium divided by 12. The section speaks of the premium "do Bộ Tài chính quy định" (set by the
-- Ministry of Finance), though Annex I is set by this Government decree (finding R11).
-- The days of a term are counted from the first day to the last, the first excluded (fork F9),
-- and no rounding is applied (fork F10).
-- src:2128 | B. Phí bảo hiểm cho thời hạn bảo hiểm khác 1 năm (chưa bao gồm thuế
-- src:2129 | giá trị gia tăng)
-- src:2130 | Đối với các xe cơ giới mua bảo hiểm có thời hạn khác 1 năm, phí bảo hiểm
-- src:2131 | được tính dựa trên phí bảo hiểm do Bộ Tài chính quy định và tương ứng với thời
-- src:2132 | hạn bảo hiểm. Cách tính cụ thể như sau:
-- src:2133 | Phí bảo hiểm năm
-- src:2134 | Phí bảo hiểm Thời hạn được
-- src:2135 | theo loại xe cơ giới
-- src:2136 | phải nộp = x bảo hiểm (ngày)
-- src:2137 | 365 (ngày)
-- src:2138 | Trường hợp thời hạn bảo hiểm từ 30 ngày trở xuống, phí bảo hiểm phải nộp
-- src:2139 | được tính bằng phí bảo hiểm năm theo loại xe cơ giới/(chia) cho 12 tháng.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Annex I section B
GIVEN `the days of the term` IS A NUMBER
      `the annual premium`   IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Annex I section B — the premium for a term of` `the days of the term` `days, on an annual premium of` `the annual premium` MEANS
    IF   `the days of the term` AT MOST 30
    THEN `the annual premium` DIVIDED BY 12
    ELSE `the annual premium` DIVIDED BY 365 TIMES `the days of the term`

GIVEN c IS A `A contract of compulsory motor insurance`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the days of the term of` c MEANS
    Day (c's `insurance ends on`) MINUS Day (c's `insurance begins on`)

-- The premium of a contract: section A where the term is exactly one year, section B otherwise.
-- "Exactly one year" is the same day and month a year on (`add years`), whatever the days in it.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 8(1), Annex I sections A and B
GIVEN c IS A `A contract of compulsory motor insurance`
GIVETH AN EITHER `A problem with the facts` NUMBER
`Annex I — the premium for the term of` c MEANS
    IF   c's `insurance ends on` AT MOST c's `insurance begins on`
    THEN LEFT `the insurance ends before it begins`
    ELSE CONSIDER `Annex I section A — the premium for a 1-year term, VAT not included, for` (c's `the vehicle`'s `class in Annex I`)
         WHEN LEFT problem THEN LEFT problem
         WHEN RIGHT annual THEN
             IF   c's `insurance ends on` EQUALS `add years` (c's `insurance begins on`) 1
             THEN RIGHT annual
             ELSE RIGHT (`Annex I section B — the premium for a term of` (`the days of the term of` c) `days, on an annual premium of` annual)

§§ `Article 8(2) — the insurer's adjustment, at most 15%`

-- The insurer may raise or lower the premium on the claims history of the vehicle or the
-- accident history of its owner, by at most 15% of the Annex I premium. The decree gives the
-- insurer no criterion for how much (finding R12). `the adjustment` is a signed fraction:
-- 0.15 raises by 15%, -0.15 lowers by 15%. Fork F11: it applies to the Annex I premium of the
-- contract's own term.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 8(2)
GIVEN `the adjustment`      IS A NUMBER
      `the Annex I premium` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN EITHER `A problem with the facts` NUMBER
`Article 8(2) — the premium after an adjustment of` `the adjustment` `to` `the Annex I premium` MEANS
    IF   `the adjustment` GREATER THAN 15% OR `the adjustment` LESS THAN (0 MINUS 15%)
    THEN LEFT `the premium adjustment exceeds 15% of the Annex I premium`
    ELSE RIGHT (`the Annex I premium` TIMES (1 PLUS `the adjustment`))

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 8(1)-(2), Annex I; Article 76(1); Decree 220/2026 Article 10(2)
GIVEN `the adjustment` IS A NUMBER
      c                IS A `A contract of compulsory motor insurance`
GIVETH AN EITHER `A problem with the facts` NUMBER
`the premium under the contract, after an adjustment of` `the adjustment` `for` c MEANS
    CONSIDER `the rules that govern` c
    WHEN `the rules Article 76(1) continues for a contract concluded before Decree 67/2023`
        THEN `a contract concluded before Decree 67/2023 is governed by earlier rules not encoded in this model`
    WHEN `Decree 67/2023, in the vintage` v THEN
        CONSIDER `Annex I — the premium for the term of` c
        WHEN LEFT problem THEN LEFT problem
        WHEN RIGHT p      THEN `Article 8(2) — the premium after an adjustment of` `the adjustment` `to` p
